  <!-- 08. FAQ AKORDEON 2 KOLOM (6 Butir) -->
  <section id="faq" class="bg-surface-soft border-y border-border-base py-14">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-green-primary uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">05 &mdash; TANYA JAWAB</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-ink">Pertanyaan Seputar Proses Pengadaan</h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink opacity-80 mt-2">Seluruh alur proses koordinasi dan administrasi dijabarkan secara transparan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <details class="group border border-border-base rounded-[8px] bg-surface p-4 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
            <span>Apa yang perlu disiapkan saat menghubungi kami?</span>
            <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-light text-green-primary font-mono text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-85 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-border-base pt-3">
            Cukup sampaikan lokasi proyek (kecamatan/kota), jenis dan mutu material yang dibutuhkan (contoh: Ready Mix K-300 atau Besi TS 420), estimasi volume, serta tanggal pengiriman yang diinginkan.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border-base rounded-[8px] bg-surface p-4 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
            <span>Bagaimana cara mendapatkan penawaran harga resmi?</span>
            <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-light text-green-primary font-mono text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-85 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-border-base pt-3">
            Setelah rincian kebutuhan terkonfirmasi via WhatsApp, tim estimator kami akan menerbitkan dokumen penawaran resmi (BoQ/RAB) berkop surat resmi melalui korespondensi email resmi perusahaan.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border-base rounded-[8px] bg-surface p-4 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
            <span>Bagaimana penjadwalan ritase armada dilakukan?</span>
            <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-light text-green-primary font-mono text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-85 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-border-base pt-3">
            Ritase armada (truk mixer, dump truck index 7/24, atau tronton) dijadwalkan berdasarkan konfirmasi PO dan kesiapan akses jalan proyek. Jadwal disepakati sebelum hari pengiriman.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border-base rounded-[8px] bg-surface p-4 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
            <span>Bagaimana proses verifikasi standar mutu SNI?</span>
            <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-light text-green-primary font-mono text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-85 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-border-base pt-3">
            Setiap pengiriman material disertai dokumen kendali mutu seperti surat jalan berspesifikasi, sertifikat uji tarik pabrik (Mill Certificate), atau sertifikat uji tekan silinder laboratorium rekanan.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border-base rounded-[8px] bg-surface p-4 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
            <span>Apakah melayani pengadaan untuk tender proyek?</span>
            <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-light text-green-primary font-mono text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-85 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-border-base pt-3">
            Ya. Kami menyediakan surat dukungan vendor dan kelengkapan administrasi pengadaan material untuk tender konstruksi BUMN maupun swasta melalui pengajuan resmi via email.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group border border-border-base rounded-[8px] bg-surface p-4 transition-colors">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-ink cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
            <span>Di mana saja cakupan wilayah pengiriman?</span>
            <span class="w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-light text-green-primary font-mono text-base transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink opacity-85 mt-3 leading-relaxed border-t border-border-base pt-3">
            Jangkauan distribusi reguler kami mencakup seluruh wilayah DKI Jakarta, Bogor, Depok, Tangerang Raya, Bekasi, serta Kawasan Industri Cikarang dan Karawang.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

